<title>UK: Munchener Hypo sets 250 mln mark REX-linked bond.</title>
<headline>Munchener Hypo sets 250 mln mark REX-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager SGZ-Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   MUNCHENER HYPOTHEKENBANK</p>
<p> AMT    250 MLN DEM   COUPON    *6.00	MATURITY    20.AUG.07</p>
<p> TYPE   REX-LINKED    ISS PRICE  102.20    PAY DATE    20.AUG.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    MUNICH    GOV  LAW    GERMAN</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) ONE	 MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC   1.50</p>
<p> NOTES	*FOR FIRST YEAR THEN 80 PCT OF THE 10-YEAR REX-YIELD</p>
<p>		 SUBINDEX</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
